# Repo-root build context (console-app's Dockerfiles build from here) --
# excludes host-built artifacts so a container's own `npm install`/`pip
# install` output never gets clobbered by a COPY of the host's copy (e.g.
# a Windows-built node_modules has no Unix execute bits, breaking `tsc`
# when it silently overwrites the container's own Linux-native install).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/data
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
